If we now have `turbopack` enabled and `postcss-prune-var` installed and configured, `PermanentMarker.variable` is `undefined`. If we either disable `turbopack` or `postcss-prune-var` it does work.

### Expectation

I would expect that `PermanentMarker.variable` is defined when using `postcss-prune-var` & `turbopack`.

